  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce4091efa6b73194680553dd3dac51da, type: 3}
  m_Name: Yuuchi_YuuchiGaming
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  sequence:
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (There's Yuuchi, gaming comfortably in his bed.)
    - (Really makes me wonder how many hours he has on that little device. Does he
      ever run out of games to play with how often Taiga buys them for him? Or does
      he replay the old ones until he finally asks for another?)
    - (Reminds me of all those nights Taiga would spend playing video games on the
      TV in our old apartment. She even did it late into pregnancy with our daughters.
      Whenever she had trouble sleeping, I'd hear the clicking of the controller
      and upbeat music just outside my old bedroom.)
    - (Now that I think about it, Katsuko likes playing video games too, doesn't
      she? Haruko too, but not as much... Has Taiga ever bought any games for Katsuko?
      Or does she just play the ones that Yuuchi has? He's never had a problem with
      sharing, from what I've seen.)
  alternateSequences: []
